  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>MYCL and EP400 are required for Max and MCPyV mediated gene activation</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>To determine if MYCL or EP400 knockdown would affect Max target genes in Merkel cell carcinoma cell line MKL-1, we performed RNA-seq analyses of MKL-1 cells inducibly expressing shMYCL and two different EP400 shRNA -2, -3 and compared to ChIP-seq data using BETA analyses. Overall design: MYCL or EP400 was inducibly reduced with shRNA in MKL-1 cells to analyze gene regulation.</DESCRIPTION>
